================================================================================
2. Dataset (K-News-Stance-MM) -- Gated Access under a Data Use Agreement
================================================================================

K-News-Stance-MM is not included in this repository. To respect the
intellectual property rights of the original news publishers, it is released
under gated access with a custom Data Use Agreement. Access instructions are
provided in `data/README.md`.

To obtain the dataset, prospective users must submit an access request
describing their research purpose and agree to the following terms:

  1. The dataset may be used only for non-commercial academic research.
  2. The dataset may not be redistributed, shared, or published, in whole or
     in part, to any third party.
  3. Publications using the dataset must cite the VFStance paper.

Copyright in the underlying news articles and images remains with the
respective publishers. Original news images are not distributed; the dataset
provides their source URLs, and each publisher's terms govern their use.
